 "title": "37 × 24 as an area",
 "caption": "Long multiplication is this rectangle cut in two: 37 × 20 = 740 and 37 × 4 = 148, and the whole area is 740 + 148 = 888. Each row of the written method is one strip.",
 "alt": "A rectangle 37 wide and 24 tall, split into a strip 37 by 20 with area 740 and a strip 37 by 4 with area 148.",
 "description": [
  "A rectangle with width 37 and height 24 stands for 37 × 24.",
  "A line cuts it into a strip 20 tall and a strip 4 tall, because 24 = 20 + 4.",
  "The large strip is 37 × 20 = 740; the thin strip is 37 × 4 = 148.",
  "Together they make 740 + 148 = 888, the answer to 37 × 24."
